fXtgpOvzP16eIw","review_id":"kVyrT9croNvurucKrFFXDw","date":"2011-10-05T02:46:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931283712387085,"text_excerpt":"I agree with the other reviewers Chris's does excellent cakes and also has some really good donuts. It is not the cheapest place but you are getting quality baked good here and that should count for something! A good choice if you are in the East and looking for a good bakery."},{"business_id":"m2dBv07BfXtgpOvzP16eIw","review_id":"oWbDWzL2yJevg4QaucyGQQ","date":"2010-12-20T23:46:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.915493905544281,"text_excerpt":"This is a BAKERY also! My friends and I have ordered several cakes from here and they all have been divine! Very moist and fresh. Also beautiful! A must try!"},{"business_id":"m2dBv07BfXtgpOvzP16eIw","review_id":"q6OPnTZs1ebh336BaHkxiw","date":"2020-11-09T03:45:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9019293785095215,"text_excerpt":"A coworker brought donuts from here as a treat. They were so fresh & fluffy. I decided to go get some again. Due to Covid there's restrictions in place. Staff is friendly and helpful. I usually go early in the morning so the donuts are hot & fresh. My staff loves them as a breakfast surprise. I haven't venture off to try their other items yet, the pastries look tasty."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"m2dBv07BfXtgpOvzP16eIw","photo_id":"vgOAkNGk-ql30INRw2T0mw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vgOAkNGk-ql30INRw2T0mw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
